   ('p', 'It is a lightening technique in which each section is separated with the air of a hairdryer: the shorter, finer hairs are blown out and stay unlightened, and only the hair that remains is worked on. The result is a diffused blonde with soft transitions and roots that grow out without a visible line.'),
